WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:42.729 --> 01:47.990
[When I Meet The Moon]

4
01:48.060 --> 01:51.020
[Episode 27]

5
02:19.520 --> 02:20.920
Where's your breakfast?

6
02:26.680 --> 02:27.470
Here.

7
02:27.810 --> 02:29.540
You haven't even opened the packaging.

8
02:29.540 --> 02:30.230
Have you been drinking coffee

9
02:30.230 --> 02:32.030
on an empty stomach all morning?

10
02:34.520 --> 02:35.380
Actually, I...

11
02:40.000 --> 02:40.630
Yeah.

12
02:42.210 --> 02:43.810
Last time we went to the cafe,

13
02:44.020 --> 02:44.740
you didn't even take a bite

14
02:44.740 --> 02:46.090
of the cake you ordered.

15
02:46.980 --> 02:48.750
Now you've been up all night working,

16
02:48.750 --> 02:51.410
and you're drinking coffee on an empty stomach?

17
02:58.280 --> 02:59.210
I wouldn't dare.

18
03:00.970 --> 03:01.900
I wouldn't dare.

19
03:04.080 --> 03:05.480
Let me ask you something.

20
03:05.910 --> 03:07.540
I'm angry right now.

21
03:08.590 --> 03:10.150
How should I lose my temper?

22
03:10.630 --> 03:11.580
I get to decide?

23
03:12.340 --> 03:14.800
I'll take your opinion into consideration.

24
03:17.940 --> 03:19.070
My opinion...

25
03:23.930 --> 03:24.810
Give me a kiss.

26
03:25.430 --> 03:26.829
A kiss will calm you down.

27
03:28.240 --> 03:29.810
You made me angry,

28
03:29.810 --> 03:30.930
and you want me to kiss you?

29
03:30.930 --> 03:32.370
Isn't that too much?

30
03:32.430 --> 03:33.680
I can kiss you too.

31
03:45.760 --> 03:47.110
I meant right here!

32
03:56.950 --> 03:57.610
Alright,

33
03:57.630 --> 03:58.570
don't be mad.

34
03:59.470 --> 04:00.280
I was wrong.

35
04:01.180 --> 04:01.970
I was wrong.

36
04:02.520 --> 04:04.780
You admit your mistakes pretty quickly.

37
04:07.120 --> 04:07.870
Then promise me,

38
04:07.870 --> 04:09.800
no more coffee on an empty stomach.

39
04:10.590 --> 04:11.240
Okay.

40
04:11.530 --> 04:12.530
Don't just say it,

41
04:12.530 --> 04:13.840
keep it in mind.

42
04:16.100 --> 04:16.740
Okay.

43
04:17.310 --> 04:17.950
Okay.

44
04:18.310 --> 04:19.510
Just another "okay."

45
04:20.480 --> 04:21.930
Okay, okay.

46
04:27.310 --> 04:28.120
Um,

47
04:29.480 --> 04:31.480
I have something to tell you.

48
04:31.680 --> 04:32.470
Sit down.

49
04:34.680 --> 04:35.480
What's wrong?

50
04:37.220 --> 04:39.730
In a while,

51
04:40.030 --> 04:42.030
I have to go on a business trip to EAW.

52
04:42.920 --> 04:44.580
I'll be going back for a while.

53
04:45.420 --> 04:46.220
Okay,

54
04:46.310 --> 04:47.570
then I'll go with you.

55
04:48.620 --> 04:50.310
Don't you have a paper to write?

56
04:50.310 --> 04:51.630
I can go by myself.

57
04:52.480 --> 04:53.630
Can't I go?

58
04:55.680 --> 04:57.930
I'll be busy with work too,

59
04:57.930 --> 05:00.530
and I'm afraid I won't be able to look after you.

60
05:02.480 --> 05:03.270
Alright,

61
05:03.740 --> 05:05.400
then I'll wait for you at home.

62
05:05.830 --> 05:06.480
Okay.

63
05:16.350 --> 05:17.160
Mrs. Jiang.

64
05:17.510 --> 05:18.310
What's wrong?

65
05:18.510 --> 05:19.190
Shize,

66
05:19.440 --> 05:21.170
why did you send us money again?

67
05:21.190 --> 05:22.840
Didn't I tell you

68
05:22.920 --> 05:24.980
not to send us money anymore?

69
05:25.120 --> 05:26.920
I know you mean well.

70
05:27.130 --> 05:28.770
Now that Grandma is gone,

71
05:29.080 --> 05:30.200
my husband and I

72
05:30.230 --> 05:31.960
can manage just fine on our own.

73
05:32.210 --> 05:34.420
You don't need to worry about us anymore.

74
05:34.420 --> 05:34.930
Okay.

75
05:36.480 --> 05:37.880
I understand, Ms. Jiang.

76
05:37.990 --> 05:39.340
If you need anything,

77
05:39.540 --> 05:40.800
just let me know anytime.

78
05:40.800 --> 05:41.500
Okay.

79
05:46.270 --> 05:47.070
What's wrong?

80
05:48.370 --> 05:49.820
What happened?

81
05:50.290 --> 05:51.790
Tell me about it.

82
05:53.659 --> 05:54.370
It's nothing.

83
05:54.370 --> 05:55.240
Mrs. Jiang

84
05:55.720 --> 05:56.530
told me not to

85
05:56.630 --> 05:58.030
send money home anymore.

86
05:58.920 --> 06:01.320
Have you been sending them money all along?

87
06:01.870 --> 06:02.370
Yeah.

88
06:03.300 --> 06:04.220
I think Yuan's death

89
06:04.220 --> 06:05.220
was because of me.

90
06:05.810 --> 06:07.140
After Yuan passed away,

91
06:08.480 --> 06:09.240
I thought I should

92
06:09.240 --> 06:10.840
take good care of his family.

93
06:12.040 --> 06:14.180
Do you still go see them?

94
06:16.230 --> 06:17.630
I used to visit them often

95
06:17.870 --> 06:19.870
because Grandma was very fond of me.

96
06:20.060 --> 06:21.790
But after Grandma passed away,

97
06:22.220 --> 06:22.980
I thought I shouldn't

98
06:22.980 --> 06:24.180
bother them anymore.

99
06:25.150 --> 06:26.000
Why not?

100
06:30.000 --> 06:30.980
When they see me,

101
06:31.070 --> 06:32.330
they'll think of Yuan.

102
06:33.890 --> 06:35.690
They'll remember that he's gone

103
06:36.830 --> 06:37.890
because of me.

104
06:39.070 --> 06:39.870
I know in their hearts,

105
06:39.870 --> 06:40.720
they blame me.

106
06:41.420 --> 06:42.890
It's not your fault.

107
06:48.470 --> 06:49.470
I think things are

108
06:49.510 --> 06:51.040
pretty good as they are now.

109
06:53.240 --> 06:55.270
It's been so long.

110
06:55.990 --> 06:57.930
You shouldn't overthink it.

111
07:00.120 --> 07:02.040
Time will heal everything.

112
07:04.500 --> 07:05.130
Yeah.

113
07:18.270 --> 07:19.120
Welcome.

114
07:27.480 --> 07:28.810
What are you doing here?

115
07:30.130 --> 07:30.980
Welcome.

116
07:34.580 --> 07:35.700
What are you up to?

117
07:36.930 --> 07:38.270
It's called a work-study plan.

118
07:38.270 --> 07:38.930
Look,

119
07:38.970 --> 07:40.200
I can study for my master's,

120
07:40.200 --> 07:41.110
keep you company,

121
07:41.110 --> 07:42.120
and make money at the same time.

122
07:42.120 --> 07:43.920
Kill three birds with one stone.

123
07:45.540 --> 07:47.940
I think you're just here to keep an eye on me.

124
07:48.890 --> 07:50.390
Strictly speaking,

125
07:50.420 --> 07:52.100
I'm your boss now.

126
07:52.240 --> 07:53.040
I could fire you right now,

127
07:53.040 --> 07:54.040
believe it or not.

128
07:54.740 --> 07:55.540
Boss,

129
07:55.630 --> 07:56.980
if you don't clock in soon,

130
07:56.980 --> 07:57.840
you'll be late.

131
08:00.220 --> 08:01.880
I'll deal with you after work.

132
08:04.930 --> 08:06.720
We'll see who deals with whom.

133
08:11.980 --> 08:12.770
Kitty.

134
08:14.720 --> 08:15.420
Kitty.

135
08:15.680 --> 08:16.610
Where's Rainie?

136
08:18.630 --> 08:19.680
I hadn't seen it since before

137
08:19.680 --> 08:20.810
I came back to Xifu.

138
08:22.430 --> 08:24.570
If it's somewhere else now,

139
08:24.950 --> 08:25.420
what if there's no one

140
08:25.420 --> 08:26.620
there to feed it?

141
08:27.270 --> 08:29.270
Could it have been taken by someone?

142
08:30.420 --> 08:30.930
If I had known,

143
08:30.930 --> 08:32.610
I would have taken it home.

144
08:34.169 --> 08:35.620
Maybe no one took it.

145
08:36.409 --> 08:37.250
Perhaps

146
08:38.250 --> 08:38.909
it found someone

147
08:38.909 --> 08:40.270
as kind-hearted as you

148
08:40.500 --> 08:41.500
who adopted it.

149
08:43.010 --> 08:43.820
Maybe it's already enjoying

150
08:43.820 --> 08:45.000
its happy cat life.

151
08:45.670 --> 08:47.270
What if none of that is true?

152
08:49.340 --> 08:50.310
Then I believe

153
08:50.840 --> 08:51.840
it will, like you,

154
08:52.410 --> 08:53.390
come back to me.

155
09:34.650 --> 09:35.850
It's been a year.

156
09:35.910 --> 09:38.170
Why does the house look exactly the same?

157
09:41.060 --> 09:42.400
I knew that one day,

158
09:42.840 --> 09:44.370
I would bring you back here.

159
09:47.270 --> 09:47.940
Fu Shize,

160
09:47.940 --> 09:49.870
aren't you a little too confident?

161
09:52.040 --> 09:53.470
Didn't I bring you back?

162
10:08.240 --> 10:09.320
There are only 2 pieces left.

163
10:09.320 --> 10:10.980
Aren't you going to finish it?

164
10:22.610 --> 10:24.070
Let's finish it together.

165
10:25.150 --> 10:26.150
So you were

166
10:26.460 --> 10:29.190
waiting for me to come back and finish it with you?

167
10:46.630 --> 10:48.890
I have to go out in a bit.

168
10:49.620 --> 10:51.480
I'm meeting my advisor for a chat.

169
10:51.940 --> 10:53.140
Need me to come along?

170
10:53.220 --> 10:54.010
No need.

171
10:54.320 --> 10:55.810
Just lend me your car.

172
10:56.450 --> 10:57.070
As for you,

173
10:57.090 --> 10:57.710
just stay at home

174
10:57.710 --> 10:59.240
and wait for me to come back.

175
11:02.240 --> 11:03.740
Then drive safely.

176
11:05.220 --> 11:06.820
My dad works at a driving school.

177
11:06.820 --> 11:07.770
I've been influenced by him since I was a kid.

178
11:07.770 --> 11:08.740
I'm super good.

179
11:10.740 --> 11:11.440
Okay.

180
11:11.850 --> 11:12.660
Really.

181
11:13.080 --> 11:15.100
I-I'm the driving queen of Xifu!

182
11:25.840 --> 11:26.940
Next time, just call,

183
11:26.940 --> 11:28.340
and I'll have Jiang deliver it to you.

184
11:28.340 --> 11:29.240
Okay.

185
11:29.670 --> 11:30.480
Goodbye.

186
11:31.740 --> 11:32.720
Miss, what would you like to buy?

187
11:32.720 --> 11:33.980
Come in and take a look.

188
11:34.240 --> 11:35.190
Hello, Auntie.

189
11:35.410 --> 11:37.480
I'm Jiang Yuan's classmate.

190
11:37.640 --> 11:38.250
I spoke to you

191
11:38.250 --> 11:39.750
on the phone before.

192
11:41.410 --> 11:42.390
It's you.

193
11:44.550 --> 11:45.340
Jiang.

194
11:46.240 --> 11:47.340
Yuan's classmate is here.

195
11:47.340 --> 11:48.140
Hello, Uncle.

196
11:48.310 --> 11:49.000
Thank you.

197
11:50.870 --> 11:51.670
Please sit.

198
11:53.130 --> 11:54.600
It's been a long time since

199
11:54.600 --> 11:56.130
Yuan's classmate visited.

200
11:56.530 --> 11:57.670
This is a gift

201
11:57.670 --> 11:58.650
for you and Auntie.

202
11:58.650 --> 11:59.270
Thank you.

203
12:00.240 --> 12:00.600
Here,

204
12:00.680 --> 12:01.270
have some water.

205
12:01.270 --> 12:02.330
Thank you, Auntie.

206
12:04.320 --> 12:05.270
Uncle, Auntie,

207
12:05.410 --> 12:07.080
how have you been?

208
12:07.770 --> 12:09.370
We've been doing quite well.

209
12:09.510 --> 12:11.120
Isn't life just like this?

210
12:11.730 --> 12:13.190
We're living it day by day.

211
12:13.410 --> 12:14.980
When we miss our son,

212
12:15.260 --> 12:16.200
we just go over

213
12:16.220 --> 12:17.510
and take a look in his room.

214
12:17.510 --> 12:18.320
Auntie,

215
12:18.320 --> 12:20.170
may I go in and take a look?

216
12:20.340 --> 12:21.130
Sure.

217
12:22.940 --> 12:24.240
Come on.

218
12:24.530 --> 12:25.340
Come in.

219
12:28.670 --> 12:30.070
Feel free to look around.

220
12:38.160 --> 12:40.200
That's his best friend.

221
12:40.480 --> 12:43.170
They grew up together.

222
12:45.940 --> 12:47.910
May I take a look at these books?

223
12:48.320 --> 12:48.870
Yes,

224
12:48.870 --> 12:50.080
feel free to look.

225
12:58.620 --> 13:00.530
These are diaries

226
13:00.530 --> 13:01.860
he wrote in high school.

227
13:01.940 --> 13:02.740
Did he stop writing

228
13:02.740 --> 13:03.980
since college?

229
13:05.150 --> 13:06.360
During college...

230
13:06.620 --> 13:08.010
His dad and I brought back

231
13:08.010 --> 13:09.820
everything from his dorm.

232
13:10.130 --> 13:11.370
We didn't see

233
13:11.370 --> 13:13.220
any diaries he wrote in college.

234
13:17.480 --> 13:19.270
Did he have a computer?

235
13:19.700 --> 13:20.510
Yes,

236
13:20.510 --> 13:22.030
it's in the drawer.

237
13:22.410 --> 13:23.470
I'll get it for you.

238
13:26.500 --> 13:27.760
This was his computer.

239
13:33.650 --> 13:34.460
Oh,

240
13:34.910 --> 13:35.650
that's the medal Yuan won

241
13:35.650 --> 13:36.980
when he was part of

242
13:36.980 --> 13:37.910
the drone team.

243
13:37.910 --> 13:38.650
You know what?

244
13:38.650 --> 13:39.910
The team he was in

245
13:39.910 --> 13:41.200
won several championships.

246
13:41.200 --> 13:42.120
Look at

247
13:42.440 --> 13:43.630
these trophies

248
13:44.290 --> 13:45.550
and medals.

249
13:46.010 --> 13:48.030
Every time he came home, he'd wipe them down

250
13:48.030 --> 13:50.030
one by one until they were spotless.

251
13:50.420 --> 13:51.880
He treasured them dearly.

252
13:58.480 --> 13:59.270
Auntie,

253
13:59.290 --> 14:00.270
can I help

254
14:00.270 --> 14:01.220
look for it together?

255
14:01.220 --> 14:02.030
Maybe we can find

256
14:02.030 --> 14:03.240
his diary from college.

257
14:03.240 --> 14:04.010
Okay.

258
14:04.910 --> 14:05.840
You can sit here.

259
14:06.490 --> 14:07.150
Have a seat.

260
14:07.740 --> 14:09.440
Call me if you need anything.

261
14:09.440 --> 14:09.860
Okay.

262
14:09.860 --> 14:10.320
Take your time.

263
14:10.320 --> 14:11.380
Thank you, Auntie.

264
14:30.040 --> 14:30.900
Uncle, Auntie,

265
14:31.130 --> 14:31.820
could I take this USB drive

266
14:31.820 --> 14:33.370
home to make a copy?

267
14:33.390 --> 14:33.960
I'll

268
14:33.990 --> 14:36.390
explain everything to you in detail later.

269
14:37.510 --> 14:38.320
Sure.

270
14:58.360 --> 14:58.960
Lili,

271
14:59.480 --> 15:00.810
why aren't you back yet?

272
15:02.550 --> 15:03.360
Shize,

273
15:03.720 --> 15:04.620
actually,

274
15:04.620 --> 15:07.020
I didn't go to NUST to meet my advisor today.

275
15:07.120 --> 15:08.960
I went somewhere else.

276
15:10.600 --> 15:12.330
You went to Jiang Yuan's house?

277
15:12.480 --> 15:13.100
Yes.

278
15:13.690 --> 15:15.500
I went to see Uncle and Auntie

279
15:16.600 --> 15:17.790
and found Jiang Yuan's

280
15:17.790 --> 15:18.920
last diary entries.

281
15:20.460 --> 15:21.250
Are you okay?

282
15:22.150 --> 15:23.280
Did Uncle and Auntie

283
15:23.630 --> 15:24.720
make things difficult for you?

284
15:24.720 --> 15:26.050
They were very nice to me

285
15:26.790 --> 15:29.100
and told me a lot of their true feelings.

286
15:30.860 --> 15:31.790
Are you outside?

287
15:32.290 --> 15:32.860
Yes.

288
15:34.120 --> 15:35.120
Wait for me there.

289
15:35.150 --> 15:36.210
I'll come find you.

290
15:52.440 --> 15:53.120
Shize,

291
15:54.190 --> 15:55.760
have you read the diary

292
15:55.790 --> 15:56.860
Jiang Yuan wrote

293
15:56.980 --> 15:58.180
in his last few years?

294
16:01.470 --> 16:01.920
No.

295
16:03.480 --> 16:04.880
After his freshman year,

296
16:05.390 --> 16:06.620
he stopped writing.

297
16:11.980 --> 16:14.080
I saved a copy to my phone.

298
16:14.510 --> 16:15.640
I just sent it to you.

299
16:24.130 --> 16:26.840
Maybe Jiang Yuan didn't tell you

300
16:26.840 --> 16:28.240
a lot of things back then.

301
16:29.440 --> 16:30.840
After you read it, you'll understand

302
16:30.840 --> 16:32.570
what he was thinking back then.

303
16:50.530 --> 16:51.730
Have Uncle and Auntie

304
16:53.740 --> 16:55.120
read these entries?

305
16:55.630 --> 16:56.370
No.

306
16:57.240 --> 16:58.510
I don't know

307
16:58.720 --> 17:00.510
how to break the news to them.

308
17:03.220 --> 17:04.180
Let me handle it.

309
17:13.510 --> 17:14.010
Lili.

310
17:15.220 --> 17:17.150
About going to Jiang Yuan's house,

311
17:18.420 --> 17:19.940
how long have you been thinking about it?

312
17:19.940 --> 17:21.089
I didn't have a plan.

313
17:23.010 --> 17:25.140
I just asked Zhou Tiao for the address.

314
17:26.810 --> 17:28.240
Before I met them,

315
17:29.220 --> 17:30.880
I didn't even know what

316
17:30.880 --> 17:32.280
I was going to say to them.

317
17:33.830 --> 17:34.790
I just hoped

318
17:35.310 --> 17:37.170
they wouldn't blame you anymore.

319
17:38.920 --> 17:41.400
And I hoped to find a way

320
17:42.450 --> 17:44.380
to stop you from blaming yourself.

321
17:49.570 --> 17:50.380
Lili.

322
17:52.600 --> 17:53.270
Thank you.

323
18:12.140 --> 18:13.510
There are two things

324
18:13.790 --> 18:16.320
that make me feel incredibly lucky in my life.

325
18:16.640 --> 18:19.350
One is that my parents love me very much.

326
18:20.530 --> 18:21.460
The other

327
18:22.110 --> 18:23.840
is having a good bro like Shize.

328
18:31.530 --> 18:32.380
Recently,

329
18:33.030 --> 18:34.680
I've been saying hurtful things

330
18:34.680 --> 18:36.460
to Shize without meaning to.

331
18:37.270 --> 18:39.900
Once I come to my senses, I always regret it.

332
18:41.110 --> 18:43.830
But I never mean any of those things.

333
19:04.380 --> 19:05.180
Shize.

334
19:06.290 --> 19:07.090
I'm leaving.

335
19:08.530 --> 19:09.790
Don't blame yourself.

336
19:11.140 --> 19:12.590
I left my notes on the digital twin research

337
19:12.590 --> 19:13.500
for you.

338
19:14.870 --> 19:16.270
I hope you won't give up

339
19:17.240 --> 19:19.980
and carry on with our dream.

340
20:11.010 --> 20:13.840
[New data update complete. Reload the digital twin project file?]

341
20:53.420 --> 20:54.480
After you get your Ph.D.,

342
20:54.480 --> 20:55.610
what are your plans?

343
20:56.190 --> 20:56.980
I plan to

344
20:57.070 --> 20:58.640
meet your parents first.

345
20:59.720 --> 21:01.510
You want to meet my parents?

346
21:02.050 --> 21:02.590
Yeah.

347
21:03.810 --> 21:04.740
My parents

348
21:04.740 --> 21:06.140
are super conservative.

349
21:06.220 --> 21:07.070
I have to

350
21:07.070 --> 21:08.470
