351
21:10.590 --> 21:12.310
Otherwise, as soon as you visit,

352
21:12.310 --> 21:14.310
they'll pressure us to get married.

353
21:14.480 --> 21:15.280
They think

354
21:15.300 --> 21:18.230
girls are at a disadvantage if they date for too long.

355
21:19.430 --> 21:20.480
Actually, I think

356
21:22.640 --> 21:24.970
I'm quite traditional in that regard too.

357
21:25.170 --> 21:26.880
I might also pressure you to get married right away.

358
21:26.880 --> 21:27.940
Please don't mind.

359
21:29.830 --> 21:31.160
Then try pressuring me.

360
21:31.940 --> 21:33.010
Do you agree?

361
21:33.350 --> 21:34.140
I...

362
21:34.610 --> 21:35.770
I don't agree.

363
21:35.920 --> 21:36.850
You don't agree?

364
21:38.070 --> 21:40.730
So you're quite traditional in that regard too.

365
21:44.600 --> 21:45.220
Yun Li.

366
21:51.460 --> 21:52.110
I see.

367
21:52.940 --> 21:54.140
Aren't you dating

368
21:54.140 --> 21:55.800
Yun Ye's teaching assistant?

369
21:57.030 --> 21:58.830
