376
22:09.420 --> 22:10.750
At the same time as Lili.

377
22:12.140 --> 22:13.420
Have you found a job?

378
22:15.680 --> 22:17.740
The school wants me to stay and teach,

379
22:17.950 --> 22:19.410
but I haven't decided yet.

380
22:19.610 --> 22:20.330
Why did you suddenly

381
22:20.330 --> 22:21.680
go back to school?

382
22:33.310 --> 22:35.440
I want to take responsibility for Lili

383
22:35.640 --> 22:37.100
and give her a better life.

384
22:39.200 --> 22:40.240
I'm sorry, Uncle.

385
22:40.480 --> 22:42.140
I left a bad impression on you

386
22:42.140 --> 22:43.220
