387
22:43.530 --> 22:45.310
Actually, I originally planned

388
22:45.310 --> 22:46.140
to invite you

389
22:46.140 --> 22:47.600
to my graduation ceremony

390
22:47.710 --> 22:50.370
after getting my doctoral degree certificate.

391
22:50.830 --> 22:51.680
My daughter

392
22:51.830 --> 22:53.240
is excellent, of course.

393
22:53.880 --> 22:55.770
These are all things you should do.

394
22:55.770 --> 22:56.350
Yes.

395
22:56.610 --> 22:57.610
As a man,

396
22:58.330 --> 22:58.990
you should

397
22:59.010 --> 23:00.810
be responsible for your family.

398
23:04.600 --> 23:05.400
However,

399
23:06.300 --> 23:06.980
there's no need

400
23:06.980 --> 23:09.510
