407
23:29.830 --> 23:31.360
Let's have a meal together.

408
23:32.060 --> 23:33.310
O-Okay, Uncle.

409
23:40.460 --> 23:40.980
He...

410
23:41.140 --> 23:41.810
Friday.

411
23:41.810 --> 23:42.240
Friday.

412
23:42.240 --> 23:43.070
Friday.

413
23:43.490 --> 23:44.300
Friday.

414
23:45.140 --> 23:46.480
How should I answer him?

415
23:46.720 --> 23:47.880
Friday is good. Friday.

416
23:47.880 --> 23:48.720
Friday.

417
23:53.140 --> 23:55.180
Our Lili isn't getting any younger.

418
23:55.510 --> 23:57.170
You're also graduating soon.

419
23:57.170 --> 23:58.750
