424
24:07.170 --> 24:08.500
My approach

425
24:08.530 --> 24:10.220
might be a bit too traditional

426
24:10.410 --> 24:12.020
for Yun Li to accept.

427
24:12.720 --> 24:13.720
But we genuinely

428
24:13.720 --> 24:14.920
want to find someone

429
24:15.270 --> 24:16.870
who can take good care of her.

430
24:17.220 --> 24:18.310
You young people all pursue

431
24:18.310 --> 24:20.310
