436
24:29.250 --> 24:30.050
Dad.

437
24:32.720 --> 24:33.510
Shize.

438
24:34.630 --> 24:36.840
My daughter is very stubborn.

439
24:37.480 --> 24:39.480
I can never win an argument with her.

440
24:40.680 --> 24:42.050
But as a father,

441
24:42.310 --> 24:43.810
I must protect her.

442
24:44.380 --> 24:45.780
It's my responsibility.

443
24:46.330 --> 24:48.070
If you genuinely

444
24:48.880 --> 24:50.420
want to be with her,

445
24:50.940 --> 24:52.220
as a man,

446
24:52.480 --> 24:54.980
you must carefully consider

447
24:55.440 --> 24:57.330
Yun Li's circumstances

448
24:57.440 --> 24:59.300
and the future you two will share.

449
25:07.310 --> 25:08.510
Uncle, rest assured.

450
25:08.980 --> 25:09.980
I will definitely

451
25:10.640 --> 25:12.370
be responsible for our future.

452
25:16.350 --> 25:16.850
Good.

453
25:17.640 --> 25:19.940
If you understand what I mean,

454
25:20.680 --> 25:22.480
then I will give you my blessing.

455
25:34.580 --> 25:35.320
Lili.

456
25:35.500 --> 25:35.960
Come,

457
25:35.960 --> 25:36.680
it's time to eat.

458
25:36.680 --> 25:37.220
Come on.

459
25:37.220 --> 25:37.920
Let's eat.

460
25:37.920 --> 25:38.530
Let's eat.

461
25:38.560 --> 25:38.940
Come on.

462
25:38.940 --> 25:39.540
Let's eat.

463
25:40.330 --> 25:41.510
Let's eat.

464
25:46.010 --> 25:47.420
Thank you so much for your help.

465
25:47.420 --> 25:48.420
It's my pleasure.

466
25:48.660 --> 25:50.770
And we really enjoy our stay here.

467
25:51.160 --> 25:52.160
You are very kind.

468
25:52.460 --> 25:53.000
Thank you.

469
25:53.000 --> 25:53.770
Welcome.

470
25:54.270 --> 25:55.070
Hello.

471
25:56.610 --> 25:57.310
Congsheng?

472
25:57.910 --> 25:59.160
Fu Zhengchu?

473
26:00.070 --> 26:01.730
Why are you dressed like this?

474
26:03.240 --> 26:04.170
What's going on?

475
26:05.180 --> 26:06.510
It's a work-study plan.

476
26:08.270 --> 26:09.380
Do our parents know

477
26:09.380 --> 26:10.720
you came to Xifu to do this?

478
26:10.720 --> 26:11.680
How am I supposed to

479
26:11.680 --> 26:12.680
tell Mom and Dad?

480
26:12.680 --> 26:14.570
Saying I came all the way here

481
26:14.910 --> 26:17.110
for love—

482
26:17.140 --> 26:19.140
wouldn't be appropriate, would it?

483
26:19.940 --> 26:20.610
Xia.

484
26:21.830 --> 26:22.850
Tangy!

485
26:22.850 --> 26:24.010
It's been ages since we last met.

486
26:24.010 --> 26:24.940
I missed you so much.

487
26:24.940 --> 26:26.010
You look so beautiful.

488
26:26.010 --> 26:26.740
Thank you.

489
26:26.920 --> 26:28.110
I happen to have the day off tomorrow.

490
26:28.110 --> 26:29.680
Let's go have a good meal.

491
26:29.680 --> 26:30.420
I made two plans.

492
26:30.420 --> 26:31.220
Pick one.

493
26:31.680 --> 26:32.470
Tang.

494
26:32.880 --> 26:33.530
Lin,

495
26:33.530 --> 26:34.240
help my friend here

496
26:34.240 --> 26:35.030
