497
26:35.030 --> 26:35.660
Okay.

498
26:36.420 --> 26:37.420
Do we have any suites available?

499
26:37.420 --> 26:38.220
Let me check.

500
26:38.220 --> 26:39.010
Yes, we do.

501
26:39.590 --> 26:40.030
Okay.

502
26:40.030 --> 26:41.070
Then use my employee account

503
26:41.070 --> 26:41.920
to upgrade her room.

504
26:41.920 --> 26:42.610
Sure thing.

505
26:42.610 --> 26:43.310
Thank you.

506
26:45.640 --> 26:46.350
Tangy,

507
26:47.030 --> 26:48.140
what's up with my brother?

508
26:48.140 --> 26:48.680
Why did he run over here

509
26:48.680 --> 26:49.740
to be a doorman?

510
26:49.920 --> 26:50.830
Ask him.

511
26:51.460 --> 26:52.940
I went through a lot of trouble

512
26:52.940 --> 26:54.350
to finally win her back.

513
26:54.350 --> 26:55.920
If I don't keep an eye on her here,

514
26:55.920 --> 26:57.810
what if she flies away?

515
26:57.810 --> 26:59.810
I'm not some sure thing that's going to

516
26:59.810 --> 27:00.610
slip away.

517
27:02.240 --> 27:03.380
But just sticking close to Tangy

518
27:03.380 --> 27:05.030
isn't going to help.

519
27:05.270 --> 27:06.240
When are you

520
27:06.310 --> 27:07.830
going to take her back to meet your parents?

521
27:07.830 --> 27:09.160
Don't keep her waiting.

522
27:09.200 --> 27:10.400
Xia...

523
27:10.650 --> 27:11.430
I've already

524
27:11.460 --> 27:13.030
followed her all the way to Xifu,

525
27:13.030 --> 27:13.790
but she still hasn't

526
27:13.790 --> 27:16.050
mentioned taking me to meet her parents.

527
27:18.180 --> 27:19.680
Then you should think about

528
27:19.680 --> 27:21.980
whether there's something wrong with you.

529
27:21.980 --> 27:22.770
Right?

530
27:23.980 --> 27:26.710
He didn't say he wanted to meet my parents either.

531
27:28.180 --> 27:29.270
Anyway, the matter between you two

532
27:29.270 --> 27:30.380
is settled.

533
27:30.380 --> 27:31.010
That's right.

534
27:31.010 --> 27:32.670
Push forward when you should.

535
27:34.000 --> 27:34.610
It's settled.

536
27:34.610 --> 27:35.010
Tang.

537
27:35.010 --> 27:35.880
It's all done for you.

538
27:35.880 --> 27:36.570
Thank you.

539
27:36.900 --> 27:37.310
Let's go.

540
27:37.310 --> 27:38.080
I'll take you to your room.

541
27:38.080 --> 27:38.750
Let's go.

542
27:39.480 --> 27:40.270
Her luggage.

543
27:41.830 --> 27:43.180
This place is really nice.

544
27:43.180 --> 27:43.810
Isn't it?

545
27:46.420 --> 27:46.880
Slow down.

546
27:46.880 --> 27:47.720
Wait for me.

547
27:50.330 --> 27:51.140
I took my eyes off you for a second,

548
27:51.140 --> 27:52.610
and you were already drinking with my dad.

549
27:52.610 --> 27:53.740
I didn't drink much.

550
27:57.770 --> 27:58.570
What's wrong?

551
27:59.440 --> 28:00.830
Can't I just kiss you?

552
28:05.710 --> 28:07.520
What do you think about

553
28:08.120 --> 28:09.650
what your dad said earlier?

554
28:10.310 --> 28:12.270
When are we going to settle down?

555
28:12.980 --> 28:13.980
What do you think?

556
28:14.010 --> 28:15.470
I'll use it as a reference.

557
28:16.510 --> 28:17.440
I'm thinking...

558
28:19.240 --> 28:20.240
Once we graduate.

559
28:20.900 --> 28:23.500
You don't have to care about what my dad thinks.

560
28:24.640 --> 28:26.180
I think normal couples

561
28:26.180 --> 28:27.830
should date for 2 or 3 years

562
28:27.830 --> 28:29.090
before settling down.

563
28:29.510 --> 28:31.400
I think we can settle down

564
28:31.430 --> 28:33.870
after graduation.

565
28:34.470 --> 28:38.020
But graduation is only half a year away.

566
28:39.000 --> 28:40.650
If you think it's too soon,

567
28:41.240 --> 28:42.740
we can get engaged first.

568
28:43.610 --> 28:46.880
How long is it usually

569
28:47.520 --> 28:49.450
between engagement and marriage?

570
28:51.490 --> 28:54.490
One to two months.

571
28:58.070 --> 28:59.270
If you think that's too slow,

572
28:59.270 --> 29:00.750
1 to 2 days is fine too.

573
29:05.140 --> 29:07.200
I'm worried that if you wait too long,

574
29:08.030 --> 29:09.890
you'll think I'm irresponsible.

575
29:10.880 --> 29:12.240
Let me think about it.

576
29:14.510 --> 29:15.770
Then think about it.

577
29:20.310 --> 29:21.770
Don't reject me.

578
29:22.770 --> 29:24.030
I can't hear you.

579
29:24.030 --> 29:24.660
Yun Lili...

580
29:24.660 --> 29:25.590
I can't hear you.

581
29:28.310 --> 29:29.330
Wrong ear!

582
29:30.640 --> 29:33.110
I said, don't turn me down again!

583
29:34.790 --> 29:35.380
No.

584
29:41.710 --> 29:43.510
[Light Chaser 3.0 Coming Soon]

585
29:44.980 --> 29:45.840
Uncle, Auntie.

586
29:46.080 --> 29:47.080
This way, please.

587
29:48.770 --> 29:49.570
Miss.

588
29:49.680 --> 29:50.510
Are we going to read

589
29:50.510 --> 29:52.180
