590
29:53.240 --> 29:54.900
You'll see when you go inside.

591
30:11.610 --> 30:12.410
Uncle.

592
30:13.140 --> 30:13.930
Auntie.

593
30:14.220 --> 30:15.040
Shize.

594
30:16.560 --> 30:17.940
Let's go home.

595
30:17.970 --> 30:19.490
We're already here.

596
30:19.530 --> 30:20.550
Dad, Mom.

597
30:33.250 --> 30:34.320
Yuan.

598
30:44.480 --> 30:45.110
Mom.

599
30:46.420 --> 30:47.050
Dad.

600
30:48.090 --> 30:50.560
How are you?

601
30:51.220 --> 30:52.010
Son.

602
30:53.330 --> 30:54.920
We miss you so much.

603
30:55.610 --> 30:56.610
We miss you...

604
31:04.550 --> 31:05.940
I miss you too.

605
31:10.380 --> 31:12.160
Mom, Dad.

606
31:13.080 --> 31:14.210
Actually, there are

607
31:15.140 --> 31:16.160
some things

608
31:16.660 --> 31:17.790
that I never had the chance

609
31:17.790 --> 31:18.660
to tell you.

610
31:20.330 --> 31:21.730
Whatever you want to say,

611
31:21.850 --> 31:23.140
you can say it now.

612
31:23.550 --> 31:24.550
Tell us.

613
31:26.070 --> 31:26.870
Actually,

614
31:28.640 --> 31:30.440
before my death,

615
31:31.700 --> 31:33.440
I was in a really bad place.

616
31:34.790 --> 31:36.450
The pressure from my research was overwhelming,

617
31:36.450 --> 31:37.820
and my advisor's expectations were too high.

618
31:37.820 --> 31:39.880
I could never meet his expectations.

619
31:40.550 --> 31:42.290
So I was in pain every day.

620
31:44.240 --> 31:44.850
Yuan.

621
31:46.360 --> 31:48.160
You haven't taken your medicine

622
31:48.160 --> 31:49.350
today, have you?

623
31:50.850 --> 31:52.310
Silly me, I almost forgot.

624
31:54.180 --> 31:56.720
Back then, I was determined to do well on my thesis.

625
31:56.720 --> 31:57.710
But my medication

626
31:57.710 --> 31:59.640
made it hard for me to concentrate.

627
32:00.960 --> 32:02.760
I wanted so badly to prove myself

628
32:03.250 --> 32:04.510
that I stopped taking

629
32:04.850 --> 32:06.250
those medicines on my own

630
32:07.310 --> 32:08.860
and even hid it from Shize.

631
32:14.920 --> 32:15.700
I'm sorry.

632
32:16.960 --> 32:17.760
I originally

633
32:18.290 --> 32:20.160
wanted to make you proud.

634
32:21.080 --> 32:21.940
I didn't expect

635
32:23.590 --> 32:25.120
to disappoint you instead.

636
32:26.000 --> 32:26.720
No.

637
32:26.720 --> 32:27.660
No, Yuan.

638
32:27.990 --> 32:28.950
You have always been

639
32:28.950 --> 32:30.410
our greatest pride.

640
32:30.780 --> 32:32.300
You didn't disappoint us.

641
32:36.020 --> 32:36.820
Shize.

642
32:38.720 --> 32:40.250
Actually, I was quite lucky

643
32:41.380 --> 32:42.610
in this life.

644
32:43.280 --> 32:44.280
I have parents

645
32:44.300 --> 32:45.360
who love me so much.

646
32:47.730 --> 32:48.580
And a bro

647
32:49.160 --> 32:50.620
who cares about me so much.

648
32:59.070 --> 32:59.880
Son.

649
33:00.440 --> 33:01.010
Mom.

650
33:01.880 --> 33:02.920
If you have anything

651
33:02.920 --> 33:04.420
you want to say to me in the future,

652
33:04.420 --> 33:05.750
you can tell me anytime.

653
33:06.810 --> 33:07.880
I will hear you.

654
33:11.810 --> 33:12.610
Shize.

655
33:13.310 --> 33:14.160
Thank you

656
33:14.480 --> 33:15.380
for helping me realize

657
33:15.380 --> 33:16.840
my dream of a digital twin.

658
33:34.160 --> 33:35.420
It's so hard to get a booking for Light Chaser.

659
33:35.420 --> 33:37.080
I haven't been able to get one.

660
33:38.370 --> 33:39.970
I recently upgraded it using

661
33:39.970 --> 33:41.830
the latest technology from XUST.

662
33:42.250 --> 33:44.580
The effect is more realistic than before.

663
33:44.660 --> 33:46.180
Thanks to my boyfriend,

664
33:46.500 --> 33:47.550
I managed to sneak in for a little while

665
33:47.550 --> 33:48.900
on maintenance day.

666
33:50.350 --> 33:51.460
In return,

667
33:51.500 --> 33:52.000
I'll take some

668
33:52.000 --> 33:53.730
really good shots of you later.

669
33:55.660 --> 33:56.110
I mean,

670
33:56.110 --> 33:57.700
I'll capture your face in its most

671
33:57.700 --> 33:59.300
authentic, original state.

672
34:01.500 --> 34:03.420
So you're not here to spend time with me.

673
34:03.420 --> 34:05.310
You're here to shoot a vlog.

674
34:05.920 --> 34:08.320
The fans asked for an extra update.

675
34:09.090 --> 34:11.050
Besides, you're my number one fan,

676
34:11.090 --> 34:12.949
so you get to appear on my channel.

677
34:18.920 --> 34:19.730
All set.

678
34:25.010 --> 34:26.870
Do you still remember how to play?

679
34:32.860 --> 34:33.800
Do you remember the first time

680
34:33.800 --> 34:35.600
I came to the experience center?

681
34:36.440 --> 34:37.010
Yes.

682
34:38.150 --> 34:40.409
Don't I need to wear the equipment today?

683
34:42.010 --> 34:42.820
No need.

684
34:43.550 --> 34:45.280
And no need to wear any harness?

685
34:45.550 --> 34:46.360
No.

686
34:47.760 --> 34:49.090
Have you been trained?

687
34:49.760 --> 34:50.550
No.

688
34:51.420 --> 34:52.210
No?

689
35:11.870 --> 35:14.680
♪ I look up at the sky ♪

690
35:15.440 --> 35:18.090
♪ And there you are, always by my side ♪

691
35:18.890 --> 35:21.300
♪ Since when did it begin? ♪

692
35:21.320 --> 35:24.520
♪ I can't quite recall ♪

693
35:24.650 --> 35:25.340
Yun Lili.

